{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dexterity, your intellect, and every one of your senses <i>(yes, even <strong>Smell</strong>)</i> to rediscover the lost path to The Catacombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/7b01d3d9a4e8a9e491f059a52759c2d7.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers unique ways to explore. <strong>Feel</strong>\u00a0an object in shadow to find a hidden mechanism with typed commands. Leap to a precarious le